Description: MCP server for HiFiBerry AudioControl playback and library APIs
 Exposes a Model Context Protocol (MCP) stdio server that wraps
 AudioControl player and library endpoints.
 .
 Provides tools for playback control, queue management,
 and library browsing using the local ACR API.
